    "title": "U.S. Postal Service coming under commerce",
    "text": "Feb. 27, 2025: 6:00 p.m.:\nU.S. Postal Service coming under commerce\nAlthough, all the house calls by postal carriers and interacting with the public may put a slight delay in the actual delivery of actual mail.\nWe interrupt the regularly scheduled “Hell No” programming with a “Hell Yeah.” Letter carriers have served American homes & businesses for 250 years. Adding this to the 376 million pieces of mail & packages we deliver to 169 million addresses every day—no problem! …\n[pic.twitter.com/Kh11vjFdK7]— Letter Carriers (@NALC_National)\n[February 27, 2025]",
